    <briefdescription>
<para>generalized Gauss-Laguerre integration </para>    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This class performs a 1-dimensional Gauss-Laguerre integration. <formula id="190">\[ \int_{0}^{\inf} f(x) \mathrm{d}x \]</formula> The weighting function is <formula id="191">\[ w(x;s)=x^s \exp{-x} \]</formula> and <formula id="192">\[ s &gt; -1 \]</formula> </para>    </detaileddescription>
